	(text "USB-C PD input. U14 requests 15 V. U15 buck + U16 ideal diode feed the +5V plane (Pico VSYS).\nU17 makes the 11.8 V +12V rail for U13; U18 gates U13's enables (see the note by U17).\nPico VBUS is NOT on +5V: USB reaches VSYS only through the Pico's own Schottky."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 308.356 232.918 0)
