	(text "Output mode, one shunt per channel (J18 = Laser 1, J19 = Laser 2):\n  1-2  50 ohm: series 47R bypassed. 4.54-5.14 V into a 50 ohm load (PicoLas LDP-V); ~12 V open circuit.\n  2-3  Hi-Z: 68R + 47R in series, 82R shunt -> 4.55-5.08 V open circuit from a 47-50 ohm source\n       (back-terminated, no overshoot on long cables); 2.3-2.6 V into 50 ohm: an LDP-V will not trigger.\n  No shunt: ~12 V open circuit, ~3.5 V into 50 ohm. Ship with both shunts on 1-2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 122 217.17 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "79630f96-a65b-4012-8b30-789e5926a044")
	)
